/-! # Cand10: a 4-element countermodel

Generated by `soup.lean_cert` from tables that `soup.check_offline.check_finite` accepted.
Source: `work/check/profile_candidates.json (smallest non-degenerate model, candidate 10)`.

Laws of the theory (· = `f`, ∘ = `g`):
- `x · (y ∘ x) = x · x`
- `x ∘ (y · x) = x ∘ x`
- `(x ∘ y) · x = x · x`
- `(x · y) ∘ x = x ∘ x`
- `(x ∘ y) · (y ∘ x) = x`
